{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get a taste of the Single Player experience in VEX MAGE! Twin elements. Infinite momentum. Danger from every direction. Merge spells, cross dimensions, and dance through deadly arenas in this lightning-fast shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/b1b10f46665714ec40535babc99dd3f1.avif?t=1755237617\" alt=\"Vexatious Combat\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enemies strike from all sides - survive by mastering your movement and aggression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/3ed7ff1af4d468a6eb213ff9668cbe86.poster.avif?t=1755237617\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/3ed7ff1af4d468a6eb213ff9668cbe86.webm?t=1755237617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/3ed7ff1af4d468a6eb213ff9668cbe86.mp4?t=1755237617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/f0e052a55e1063b52086e5678f17a54d.avif?t=1755237617\" alt=\"Combine The Elements\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assign elemental runes to each hand and fuse them for devastating results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/619e7adf3acd607189ff791bce4718c4.poster.avif?t=1755237617\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/619e7adf3acd607189ff791bce4718c4.webm?t=1755237617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/619e7adf3acd607189ff791bce4718c4.mp4?t=1755237617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/c39356d37d382b2936f73d721a04496d.avif?t=1755237617\" alt=\"Global Leaderboards\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Leave your mark and fight your way up the global ranks, where only the deadliest rise to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/9b41be805cb709ee674e53698533425e.poster.avif?t=1755237617\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/9b41be805cb709ee674e53698533425e.webm?t=1755237617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/9b41be805cb709ee674e53698533425e.mp4?t=1755237617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The full game will include:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rapid-Fire Campaign:</strong> Levels that explode with speed, chaos, and pure adrenaline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/f16c23788dc8ed58da131cd3347f4208.poster.avif?t=1755237617\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/f16c23788dc8ed58da131cd3347f4208.webm?t=1755237617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/f16c23788dc8ed58da131cd3347f4208.mp4?t=1755237617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Co-op Multiplayer:</strong> Fight alone or with up to two allies. The challenge adapts, so every run is a test of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/d7e405ce7123d73f555787133ff6f9a3.poster.avif?t=1755237617\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/d7e405ce7123d73f555787133ff6f9a3.webm?t=1755237617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/d7e405ce7123d73f555787133ff6f9a3.mp4?t=1755237617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>VR Support:</strong> Unleash all six degrees of freedom and experience deeper immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844320/extras/80857ea6a6bc441e51fb453088df9be9.poster.avif?t=1755237617\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://sh